{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>ViuTV原創劇《地獄大狀》昨晚（22日）迎來大結局，劇中魏浚笙（Jeffrey）與林愷鈴（Ashley）的虐心戀情終於開花結果！不過日前播出的第11集中，兩人在「公仔收容所」上演一幕肉緊激咀戲，竟然引發網民在Threads開po公審。有網民狂轟已有女友的Jeffrey錫得太「狼死」，狠批他「唔檢點」。面對無理指控，Jeffrey親自霸氣上水反擊，爆出原來正牌女友當時一直全天候在現場督師！</p><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙公認靚仔。（ig@jeffreyngai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190386912389500928376801.png/IlCw1TGyFAoTsX0IfiC3RRHx_no0-owuF-Y9mhfmPZo\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙公認靚仔。（ig@jeffreyngai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《地獄大狀》昨晚（22日）迎來大結局。（劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190386917771055104817230.png/0-brFpq_6QgWP1x7ZonOPaigJ8xzV6tQhAM_UIQDP1A\"/><figcaption>《地獄大狀》昨晚（22日）迎來大結局。（劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeffrey與林愷鈴終於開花結果！（劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190386914872659968814362.png/R33viCDuc21nkTjp-d5FkBLC1LpQ6dBcL0hiuS9IYrk\"/><figcaption>Jeffrey與林愷鈴終於開花結果！（劇照）</figcaption></figure><p>PTBF情深激吻融化拜金女</p><p>在劇中，Jeffrey飾演的兼職男友（PTBF）金賢斌是個純情專一的超級暖男，為了幫Ashley飾演的拜金女邱蔭蔭積陰德，默默開設了「公仔收容所」，更願意用自己的生命去守護對方。這份無私的愛最終成功融化了邱蔭蔭冰封的心靈，決定將金賢斌正式私有化。兩人由買賣關係「升呢」為真男女朋友，情到濃時更上演深情激吻，雙方都演得極度投入，火花四濺。</p><figure><img alt=\"Jeffrey與林愷鈴終於開花結果！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387122406821888362518.png/w3MuL3Sj-hjAtV3eC1Bm1P-FxrrFiHSWHDnNyBw5zcg\"/><figcaption>Jeffrey與林愷鈴終於開花結果！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeffrey與林愷鈴有多場吻戲。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387126987264000516703.png/M6dBretUGLEIQOv7cDxXU7evTJuXx68xb0DPJG9AzyQ\"/><figcaption>Jeffrey與林愷鈴有多場吻戲。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"錫得好肉緊。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387124785123328305961.png/4F5sWYF4S7wtE_iCGfwYMEUy_D9VTPwMtaRSj7WkUo8\"/><figcaption>錫得好肉緊。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Jeffrey飾演的兼職男友（PTBF）金賢斌。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387120087240704714085.png/RzrQC6qrh6qMdwYygDzcC8ebM6WSn_7FFylg9RcpYPU\"/><figcaption>Jeffrey飾演的兼職男友（PTBF）金賢斌。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"用情專一。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387314279714816386512.png/Sgi-9Pga7wV5c7dgKNSJd2MNB7XU-t-gLUmwxC1JsMQ\"/><figcaption>用情專一。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"錫得好肉緊。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387307274833920947150.png/TsHuyHDO8voVLpS89znumfwnaMZn5bTyNl0FMjZdBTI\"/><figcaption>錫得好肉緊。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"錫得好肉緊。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387309682495488631952.png/-RrQ4P9WahSSQVXb2rLMK8XVI3iAgrWXoT5fW6E-X1s\"/><figcaption>錫得好肉緊。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"錫得好肉緊。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387311926579200238145.png/ikWq3aARU6Oq1E_nQGaJ13ALrqm5l4rNRxRgNEcUYDQ\"/><figcaption>錫得好肉緊。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>網民批「唔檢點」 替正牌女友呻慘</p><p>不過這幕唯美吻戲，卻惹來部分網民不滿。有網民在Threads上發文強烈譴責，狠批早已公開有拍拖多年女友Evelyn的Jeffrey在鏡頭前錫得太過「狼死」，更質疑：「做戲還做戲，係咪要檢點啲？」該網民認為Jeffrey早前才在社交平台大晒與女友慶祝拍拖周年紀念，轉頭就拍親熱戲是「唔妥」的表現，直言「真心為佢女朋友覺得慘」。</p><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙騷爆肌呢幕好吸睛。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387539576360960925148.png/04FjjA_XSyQWXPeNry-yaWWCHmef-CqMxR6GiMUehog\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙騷爆肌呢幕好吸睛。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387677363441664048619.png/_5QffWUEUPeSkyTOzrbpQsFJ3lu7WSw3sDgynrA4Mp4\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387683592245248894726.png/180k_RNTv6yA6l_drhUOfeDR2p0ENoHGWER5yFhEecg\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387685932797952291670.png/gzvzYw5b9ueqzHbYUAnoqT25gJMWVx1Hcf-kLXH_pC0\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387688839581696109682.png/2vtDptu2bRqvC4RTy7HaqtX2BixA4yVdemNiMXpjYjE\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387677229223936809416.png/qmJDlXBR-XSIsS0Iq3eaIzrsP9mhtFH13nCNJN5wjSQ\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙騷爆肌！（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙同潘燦良都有一場親吻戲。（劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387542063714304406271.png/oACccg8KfFS9R7_jzjV0bHhlcdLI7vQd-EpkEvhKZBI\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙同潘燦良都有一場親吻戲。（劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潘燦良「鬼上身」同魏浚笙激吻。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387827989286912531482.png/rKtE5vlVJnBXnX1rH8TJBd_Eq5wCHes1-uzPUfrsz1E\"/><figcaption>潘燦良「鬼上身」同魏浚笙激吻。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"潘燦良「鬼上身」同魏浚笙激吻。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387832083058688385074.png/SS3tiOpt53etpgZ-Kf7yy2j1y0rBGQjN2LVs9ti1bPY\"/><figcaption>潘燦良「鬼上身」同魏浚笙激吻。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>網民笑樓主清朝人 Jeffrey上水揭女友親自督師</p><p>該公審帖文一出，隨即引來大批網民圍剿樓主，嘲笑發文者思想保守得如同「清朝人」，直指演員專業拍親熱戲實屬平常。更有心水清的網民搬出經典神作反擊：「梁朝偉拍《色，戒》嗰時，你係咪要替劉嘉玲心臟病發埋？」</p><p>眼見引發連串風波，Jeffrey亦親自在帖文下霸氣回覆。他首先強調自己只是「做好演員本份」，對於被指責「唔檢點」，他大方踢爆拍攝吻戲時的幕後真相：「事實係女朋友仲喺現場俾晒reference叫我放膽去做，先對得住個角色，其實有咩問題呢？」神回覆不僅完美擊退負評，更展現了與女友之間的極大信任。</p><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙現身回應網民「質問」。（threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387409666445312601873.png/RLKzE56bZswiBM8wqvNN9--AaJsQp1_mU6eIFlOniBY\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙現身回應網民「質問」。（threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙現身回應網民「質問」。（threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387407418167296841907.png/4txMe2hazzmk2v_bGDfyne_6QOR-U7ddWaD9D1mg_Q8\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙現身回應網民「質問」。（threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙現身回應網民「質問」。（threads截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190387405195055104605421.png/uPO_GwKq9o8noPzmL5BOIyf3U1pNH9qSXWY0IV1mNCE\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙現身回應網民「質問」。（threads截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>姊弟戀拍拖10年 曾求婚遭拒</p><p>事實上，Jeffrey早在17歲參與聯校活動時，已對比他年長的Evelyn一見鍾情。兩人在2016年更曾一齊拍攝微電影，當時女主角正是初戀女友Evelyn。這段「姊弟戀」至今已長跑10年，Evelyn後來更成為了Jeffrey的經理人，二人兩便一齊打拼，男方亦曾在ViuTV節目《調教你男友》中高調放閃。早前Jeffrey更曾透露，原來自己已經向女友求過婚，可惜慘食白果被對方拒絕，可見兩人感情早已昇華至另一層次，絕對不受一幕激吻戲影響。</p><figure><img alt=\"姊弟戀拍拖10年，魏浚笙曾求婚遭拒。（ig@jeffreyngai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190386777165402112948102.png/iIj7upoFME5cvGPkREHy8gpOpNAihnnUOi_JHzovyR8\"/><figcaption>姊弟戀拍拖10年，魏浚笙曾求婚遭拒。（ig@jeffreyngai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姊弟戀拍拖10年，魏浚笙曾求婚遭拒。（ig@jeffreyngai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190386774900346880031924.png/w1K4GerHUnIofYzP3dHLX8MrSHQSN8F8xssnx8bLJ8c\"/><figcaption>姊弟戀拍拖10年，魏浚笙曾求婚遭拒。（ig@jeffreyngai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"姊弟戀拍拖10年，魏浚笙曾求婚遭拒。（ig@jeffreyngai）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190386772576571392629370.png/weskc-DZOhmaqky-i9MuQDHKrjE4rYnRG4wJWxuMCVs\"/><figcaption>姊弟戀拍拖10年，魏浚笙曾求婚遭拒。（ig@jeffreyngai）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"魏浚笙拍攝ViuTV節目《調教你男友》為人熟悉。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190386821796728832967035.png/1e2ufF7VrOBuQETj6vG-chSESr9y5eBtTZMJ6E2TCeg\"/><figcaption>魏浚笙拍攝ViuTV節目《調教你男友》為人熟悉。（截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.376403+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1616,"images":27,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T12:15:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:36.628750+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:30.249627+00:00","content_hash":"30a07dc06d37e307b63c8e8ef2fa921620cd1b8923c0ddad5e9a4403b31a17f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}